      <p source="#source-483-764"><seg source="#source-483-498">表に御記被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-498-510">レ</note><seg source="#source-510-606">成候六条ハ、小、西、両氏及老兄、龍等も御同席ニて談論セシ所ニて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-606-630"><rb>毛</rb><rt>（すこし）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630-642">も相違無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-642-654">レ</note><seg source="#source-654-708">之候。後来といへども決して変り候事無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-708-720">レ</note><seg source="#source-720-764">之ハ、神明の知る所ニ御座候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-764-793" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-785-793"><seg source="#source-785-793">丙寅</seg></p>
      </div>
